WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.410
Around 1740, in a small
town in what is now Ukraine,

2
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:08.620
a healer called the Master of
the Good Name gathers followers.

3
00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:10.860
He leaves almost no writings.

4
00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:14.210
But stories of his healing
and wonders spread.

5
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.770
His followers become known as the Hasidim,

6
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:20.010
and their movement
spreads from town to town.

7
00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:25.360
So can dancing and singing really bring
you closer to God than years of study?

8
00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:28.220
In this mission, you'll
meet the rebbe, his court,

9
00:00:28.270 --> 00:00:30.320
and his table on the Sabbath.

10
00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.140
Then you'll see how
Hasidic groups live today,

11
00:00:33.190 --> 00:00:37.050
and weigh up whether this
movement helped Judaism survive.

12
00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:41.520
Your mission: find out whether dancing
and singing can bring you closer to God

13
00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:42.450
than study.
